---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面不存在" description="你访问的页面不存在。">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">404</p>
      <h1>这页暂时走丢了。</h1>
      <p>可以回到首页，从同意、避孕、检测或身体常识重新开始。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/">回到首页</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/sources/">查看来源说明</a>
      </div>
    </header>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
